SUMMARY:Bird Photography by Maya Mehta
DESCRIPTION:Maya Mehta\, an 8th grader in Davis\, will be showing her bird photography at Super Owl Brewing in September. Maya started her birding and photography journey during the pandemic\, when she was 7. Encouraged by her parents with an old camera\, she has been sharing her pictures from India and the US regularly at local venues. This will be her 4th year sharing her pictures at Super Owl.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/bird-photography-by-maya-mehta/
