SUMMARY:Art Farm Exhibition
DESCRIPTION:YoloArts is pleased to be celebrating our 19th Annual Art Farm Exhibition. All of the pieces in this exhibition are original artworks by local and regional artists\, all of whom were inspired by Yolo County farms\, farmlands\, and agricultural practices. These unique pieces fill both the Juried and Art Harvest sections of the exhibition. \nThe Art Farm exhibition runs through October 17 at The Barn Gallery. \nThe Barn Gallery is located at 512 Gibson Road\, Woodland and is open Tuesday\, Wednesday\, Thursday from 12 – 5pm and Saturday from 12 – 3pm. For more information\, contact YoloArts by calling or texting 530-723-9781 or emailing ya@yoloarts.org. \nIMAGE: “Where the Day Waits”\, Aashi Labana
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/art-farm-exhibition/
LOCATION:The Barn Gallery\, 512 Gibson Road\, Woodland\, CA\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art,Community
