SUMMARY:Homemade Gnocchi & Squash Cooking Class
DESCRIPTION:🍂👩‍🍳 Homemade Gnocchi & Squash Cooking Class 🍷🍝\nSaturday\, October 3 | 11am\nGet ready to roll up your sleeves and cook up something delicious! Join us at Great Bear Vineyards for a hands-on\, plant-based cooking class celebrating the warm\, comforting flavors of the season. 🌿🍷\nLearn how to make soft\, pillowy vegan gnocchi from scratch\, paired with a rich mushroom and seasonal squash sauce. Along the way\, you’ll pick up practical kitchen skills and plenty of tips for creating flavorful\, restaurant-worthy plant-based meals at home.\n👩‍🍳 In This Hands-On Class\, You’ll Learn:\n🥔 How to make fresh gnocchi from scratch\n🎃 How to select and cook seasonal vegetables\n🍄 How to create a flavorful squash & mushroom sauce\n🔪 Essential knife and ingredient-prep techniques\n🌱 Tips for building a balanced\, delicious plant-based meal\n🍽️ On the Menu:\n🥬 Massaged Kale Salad\nFresh kale with cherry tomatoes\, red onion\, dried cranberries\, and vegan Parmesan\, tossed in a light dressing.\n🍝 Handmade Gnocchi with Seasonal Squash & Mushroom Sauce\nPillowy homemade potato gnocchi served with roasted seasonal squash in a savory mushroom sauce\, finished with fresh herbs and vegan Parmesan. 🤤\nWhether you’re new to cooking or already love spending time in the kitchen\, this class is a fun way to learn new skills\, enjoy seasonal ingredients\, and discover just how delicious plant-based cooking can be!\n🎟️ Ticket Includes:\n👩‍🍳 Cooking Class\n🥕 All ingredients\n🔪 Equipment\n🍷 A glass of Great Bear wine\nCome hungry\, get hands-on\, and leave with new skills and plenty of inspiration for your next dinner party!
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/homemade-gnocchi-squash-cooking-class/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards (Great Bear)\, 24800 County Rd 101A
CATEGORIES:Food & Drink
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Cooking-Class-Thumbnail.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
GEO:38.5818013;-121.7499687
