SUMMARY:Davis Women's Circles (Woven series)
DESCRIPTION:Davis Women’s Circles are made for all mamas\, including pregnant ones! This closed circle series is held once a month\, Oct-Jan. The same small group of mamas will be exploring different motherhood topics while also learning basket weaving! Held in a beautiful\, uplifting and safe space\, you get to slow down\, reset\, connect\, and discover what mothering on your own terms looks like. Advanced sign-up required (https://tocarrywonder.com/davis-womens-circles/). Sliding-scale tickets available.
